112
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:42,140
And for 30 years, he represented Iowa and fought for the working class, the small businesses, the small family farms.
三十年里，他代表艾奥瓦，为劳动者、小企业和家庭农场奋斗。

113
00:13:42,420 --> 00:13:49,160
He fought for the little guy, the same people I am fighting for, those that cannot afford to make a political donation.
他为普通人而战；也正是我现在要为之奋斗的人，那些连政治捐款都负担不起的人。

114
00:13:50,060 --> 00:13:50,940
Thank you, sir.
先生，谢谢您。

115
00:13:54,520 --> 00:14:02,820
For 448 days, I have said it is going to be beautifully poetic when the man who takes back Senator Harkin's seat is only there because of his work.
四百四十八天来，我一直说：那个夺回哈金参议员席位的人，正是因为他的工作才走到这里，这将是多么有诗意。

116
00:14:02,820 --> 00:14:11,112
Well, Iowa, tonight we made history, and we wrote beautiful poetry.
而今晚，艾奥瓦，我们创造了历史，也写下了美丽的诗篇。

117
00:14:13,424 --> 00:14:18,049
Thank you.
谢谢。

118
00:14:18,940 --> 00:14:23,870
Now, can everyone in my family come join me?
现在，我的家人都可以上台来吗？

119
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,700
I would like to bring my family up here.
我想请家人一起上来。

120
00:15:01,290 --> 00:15:11,269
You got a big family.
你家人可真多。

121
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:13,700
I got a big family and a tall family.
我有一个大家庭，而且大家都很高。

122
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:23,360
So to each and every person that knocked doors, made phone calls, donated money, put up a sign,
感谢每一个敲门、打电话、捐款、竖起支持标牌的人，

123
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:27,100
And most importantly entrusted me with your vote.
最重要的，感谢每一个用选票把信任托付给我的人。

124
00:15:27,300 --> 00:15:28,740
Genuinely, thank you.
发自内心地，谢谢你们。

125
00:15:29,420 --> 00:15:31,620
I want to thank everyone that has supported me.
我想感谢每一个支持过我的人。

126
00:15:34,350 --> 00:15:37,390
To my wife, my family, my friends.
我的妻子、家人、朋友。

127
00:15:37,890 --> 00:15:41,190
Thank you all for your support and thank you all for believing in me.
感谢你们的支持，也感谢你们相信我。

128
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:52,640
To my staff, our volunteers who put their lives on pause because they believed in what we were doing.
我的工作人员、志愿者，因为相信我们所做的事，而暂停了自己的生活。

129
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:55,200
From the bottom of my heart, thank you.
我从心底感谢你们。

130
00:15:58,740 --> 00:16:05,020
Tonight, Iowa, we have done something truly historic, and I am proud to be your senator elect.
今晚，艾奥瓦，我们做了一件真正具有历史意义的事；我为成为你们的候任参议员而自豪。

131
00:16:13,090 --> 00:16:16,170
And now the real work begins.
现在，真正的工作开始了。

132
00:16:16,790 --> 00:16:20,230
And together we are going to change this state and change our country.
我们将一起改变这个州，改变我们的国家。

133
00:16:20,630 --> 00:16:21,630
God bless Iowa.
愿上帝保佑艾奥瓦。

134
00:16:22,150 --> 00:16:23,070
God bless you all.
愿上帝保佑你们所有人。

135
00:16:23,350 --> 00:16:26,250
And God bless the greatest country on the earth, United States of America.
愿上帝保佑世界上最伟大的国家，美利坚合众国。

136
00:16:26,490 --> 00:16:27,010
Thank you all.
感谢大家。

137
00:16:29,061 --> 00:16:34,946
Thanks everybody.
谢谢各位。

138
00:16:34,956 --> 00:16:40,040
USA.
美国！